2493-    /**
2494-     * Updates leader election info to avoid inconsistencies when
2495-     * a new server tries to join the ensemble.
2496-     *
2497-     * Here is the inconsistency scenario we try to solve by updating the peer
2498-     * epoch after following leader:
2499-     *
2500-     * Let's say we have an ensemble with 3 servers z1, z2 and z3.
2501-     *
2502-     * 1. z1, z2 were following z3 with peerEpoch to be 0xb8, the new epoch is
2503-     *    0xb9, aka current accepted epoch on disk.
2504-     * 2. z2 get restarted, which will use 0xb9 as it's peer epoch when loading
2505-     *    the current accept epoch from disk.
2506-     * 3. z2 received notification from z1 and z3, which is following z3 with
2507-     *    epoch 0xb8, so it started following z3 again with peer epoch 0xb8.
2508-     * 4. before z2 successfully connected to z3, z3 get restarted with new
2509-     *    epoch 0xb9.
2510-     * 5. z2 will retry around a few round (default 5s) before giving up,
2511-     *    meanwhile it will report z3 as leader.
2512-     * 6. z1 restarted, and looking with peer epoch 0xb9.
2513-     * 7. z1 voted z3, and z3 was elected as leader again with peer epoch 0xb9.
2514-     * 8. z2 successfully connected to z3 before giving up, but with peer
2515-     *    epoch 0xb8.
2516-     * 9. z1 get restarted, looking for leader with peer epoch 0xba, but cannot
2517-     *    join, because z2 is reporting peer epoch 0xb8, while z3 is reporting
2518-     *    0xb9.
2519-     *
2520-     * By updating the election vote after actually following leader, we can
2521-     * avoid this kind of stuck happened.
2522-     *
2523-     * Btw, the zxid and electionEpoch could be inconsistent because of the same
2524-     * reason, it's better to update these as well after syncing with leader, but
2525-     * that required protocol change which is non trivial. This problem is worked
2526-     * around by skipping comparing the zxid and electionEpoch when counting for
2527-     * votes for out of election servers during looking for leader.
2528-     *
2529-     * See https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZOOKEEPER-1732
2530-     */
